"Vera" is math-inspired art showing the beauty of orderly chaos.

  The model renders complex objects in three-dimensional space.

 The image is a set of small noisy dots, combination of it creates bizarre shapes. 

  Made with p5.js and WEBGL.

There are four traits:
- 7 “Color transformer scheme”;
- 2 “Base function type”;
- 3 “Location scheme”;
- 6 “Function transformer”.

  Press 's' to save .png with resolution 2000px * 2000px  

Viewing on a large screen is recommended - the images contain a lot of detail.


